1
00:00:51,472 --> 00:00:55,280
This year, my goal is to be really fit.

2
00:00:55,760 --> 00:00:59,120
I jog, swim, and do sit-ups.

3
00:00:59,824 --> 00:01:05,824
But my favourite way of keeping fit is to use an exercise app to work out.

4
00:01:06,256 --> 00:01:10,128
The app gives me exercises to do every day.

5
00:01:10,672 --> 00:01:12,752
It can show my progress.

6
00:01:13,168 --> 00:01:16,016
My friends use the app too.

7
00:01:16,208 --> 00:01:19,056
We have fun when we keep fit together

